---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant R as React (ChatbotPage)
    participant A as API POST /api/chatbot/query
    participant C as ChatbotService
    participant N as NLU (nlu.py)
    participant I as IrrigationService
    participant W as WeatherService
    participant P as Perception
    participant K as KBAgent
    participant F as ForwardChainer (decide)
    participant E as ExplanationBuilder
    participant B as BackwardChainer

    U->>R: "هل أسقي الطماطم اليوم؟"
    R->>A: {message, session_id, language, optional manual inputs} + Bearer JWT
    A->>C: handle(message, session_id, language, manual inputs)
    C->>C: load / create ChatSession (owner only)
    C->>N: normalize(message)
    N-->>C: "هل اسقي الطماطم اليوم"
    C->>N: detect_intent · extract_quantity_l · extract_date · extract_labeled · match_candidates(user's plantings)
    N-->>C: irrigation_advice (3.5), date = today, plantings = [tomato…]
    alt more than one matching planting
        C->>C: reply status = clarification ("Which planting do you mean?"), options = planting chips, pending slot = planting
    else exactly one planting (or chosen chip)
        C->>I: recommend(farm_crop_id, date, available_water_l, et0_override_mm, precipitation_override_mm, persist = false)
        I->>I: get_planting + get_farm (Perm.AI_RUN), load_knowledge
        I->>W: get_weather(farm, params)
        W-->>I: WeatherStatus fresh · cached · unavailable
        I->>P: perceive_irrigation(ctx)
        P-->>I: percepts (true/false/unknown) + FAO-56 calculation
        I->>K: run_cycle(percepts, focus_group = irrigation_action, goals)
        K->>K: TELL(known percepts)
        K->>F: decide(rules, working memory)
        F-->>K: fired rules, agenda, conflict sets, winner
        K->>E: build(decision, goals = [irrigate_today, skip_irrigation_today])
        E->>B: ask(goal, known percepts)
        B-->>E: proof tree · missing percepts
        E-->>K: explanation contract
        K->>K: TELL(action), t ← t + 1
        K-->>I: AgentCycle
        I-->>C: {status, explanation}
        alt recommendation derived
            C->>C: template answer (recommendation, why, rules, advisories)
        else insufficient data
            C->>C: list missing-data hints. If ET0 or rain is missing: pending slot weather_inputs, ask for "ET0 6.2 rain 0". Else if available water is missing: pending slot available_water_l, ask how many litres
            Note over C: next message «التبخر 6.2 المطر 0» or "5000 لتر" fills the slot and re-runs the agent
        end
    end
    C->>C: store ChatMessage (user + assistant) and session.state
    C-->>A: {session_id, intent, text, status, options, explanation, nlu}
    A-->>R: ChatReply (200)
    R-->>U: answer bubble, quick-reply chips, "Show reasoning" (RecommendationCard)
